// transposer_32 — placeholder transposer shell.
// Purpose: Minimal pass-through so library imports and batch synthesis succeed until a full N-lane permute is authored.
// Topology: Single flow path `in0` → `out0` (no controlled lane permutation yet).
// Collaborator takeaway: Stub only; a real transposer needs flow buses + control select bits.
module Transposer_32(
    finput in0,  // FLOW inlet(s)
    foutput out0  // FLOW outlet(s)
);
    assign out0 = in0;  // continuous FLOW assign
endmodule
